  "description": "Bead mw-ju8.9: the first building in town in grey box, built from the e00 kit only. A 10 x 8 m ground-floor shop (front door on the street side, long counter with Ottilie Marsh behind it, shelves, crates, barrels and sacks, a hearth and lanterns) and, up a 3 m wooden stair (12 steps, kit stairs x3) in the east corner, her 8 x 6 m home (bed, table and chairs, desk, wardrobe, hearth, dormer light). Open-topped like every kit scene: the second-floor slab is the ground floor's ceiling. Furniture is kit stand-ins with named marker spawns so art can dress them later. The counter opens the shop screen for merchant marsh-general-store (tag merchant:<id>, verb talk); dev-crowns:400 tops the player up on first opening so the dev scene can trade. Reach it with ?scene=marsh-store; the street-exit transition leads out to briar-glen-lane (mw-e01.11).",
